<!-- Adaptive-icon background for the Summer alias: sky, sun, sea, ground and road, in that
     theme's own colours. Nothing here is invented for the icon: SceneTheme.BEACH.skyDay for the
     sky ramp and the two blues the scene actually paints the water with; hillColorsDay[1] is the
     sand.

     Containment: the only drawing that has to stay inside the safe zone is the sun, at 31.03 dp
     from the centre against a safe radius of 33 dp, so 1.97 dp of margin. Everything else in this
     file reaches the edge or lies outside the mask on purpose: sky, sea, ground, asphalt, centre
     line, wave crests and the sail boat are background that bleeds under any launcher mask, and
     clipping them is the intended behaviour. -->
